                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "0 out of 10\n\nHow do you spot a fake review. Easy just read all the stellar recommendations below from people with only 1 or 2 reviews on their Steam account and for some reason feel the need to sing the praises for this barely functional pile of garbage.\n\nI got was unlucky enough to receive this steaming pile within a VR bundle and this clearly was included to make up the numbers to pad out the collection. Please don't buy this, it's barely functional. It looks horrible, the controls are frustrating, there's no menus, no instructions; and level design is junk. Avoid.",
